flowchart TD
    START --> retrieve[retrieve: bounded retry]
    retrieve --> decide[decide: sufficiency policy]
    decide -->|answered| generate[generate: grounded JSON + citation validation]
    decide -->|clarify| terminal_clarify[terminal: clarify]
    decide -->|insufficient_evidence| terminal_insufficient[terminal: insufficient_evidence]
    decide -->|error| terminal_error[terminal: error]
    generate --> END
    terminal_clarify --> END
    terminal_insufficient --> END
    terminal_error --> END
